@startuml
title FoodLedger 目前系統架構圖

skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam shadowing false
left to right direction

actor "使用者" as User
actor "開發者" as Developer

node "前端專案" as Frontend {
  component "React Web\nFoodLedger_FrontEnd" as Web
}

node "後端服務" as Backend {
  component "ASP.NET Core Web API\nFoodLedger" as Api
}

database "PostgreSQL\nFoodledger DB" as Db

node "監控與觀察" as Observability {
  component "Aspire Dashboard\n開發期觀察" as Aspire
  component "Kibana / ELK\n後續集中式 logs" as Elk
}

User -right-> Web : 操作畫面
Web -right-> Api : JSON API\nBearer Token
Api -right-> Db : EF Core / Npgsql
Developer -down-> Aspire : 查看本機服務狀態
Api -down-> Aspire : logs / traces / health
Developer -down-> Elk
Api ..down..> Elk : 後續導入 logs

note right of Api
後端負責：
- Auth / Identity
- DailyRecord
- DefinedCode
- Nutrition Summary
end note

note bottom of Db
資料庫保存：
- 使用者
- 食物與營養素
- 每日飲食紀錄
- 通用代碼
end note

@enduml
